    },
    {
      "displayText": "Among the nine, this one—the Hibernal Pokémon\nCenter—sells the fewest Poké Balls by far...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǆ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
