      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Allow me to explain.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǆ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1168,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0041006C006C006F00770020006D006500200074006F0020006500780070006C00610069006E002E00100002011401C60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Don’t you think our countertop looks lonely?\nThere’s so mush-room to liven it up.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǆ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1220,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 86
    },
    {
      "displayText": "But a <U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>Foongus<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000> sitting here would look just like a\nPoké Ball. That kind of Pokémon is sure to lure<U+0010><U+0001>븀\npeople in and make them want to buy Poké Balls!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǆ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 10,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1392,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 161
    },
    {
